<title>ISRAEL: Samsung Electronic team to visit Israel.</title>
<headline>Samsung Electronic team to visit Israel.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Electronics will send a high level delegation to Israel near the end of March for meetings with more than 100 Israeli firms, Israel's Trade and Industry Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will investigate dozens of investments and joint projects with Israeli companies,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The ministry said the delegation would meet with among others Israel Aircraft Industries, Tadiran Ltd, ECI Telecom and Motorola's Israel subsidiary.</p>
<p>Israeli media said in early November, after another Samsung delegation visited, that the South Korean firm and Israel's Vocaltec were in talks on cooperating in technology.</p>
<p>At that time, the Israel Export Institute said Samsung was considering setting up a research and development centre in Israel.</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom 972-2-537-0502</p>
